	(text "Rev 0.1 - May 04, 2016:  Prototype\nRev 1.0 - September 20, 2016:\n  * P. 11 : changed fixation hole from 2.8 mm to 3.1 mm\nRev 1.1 - April 27, 2017:\n  * P. 5 : added note for MAX IV\n  * P. 9 : adjusted amplification stages gains\nRev 1.2 - August 10, 2017:\n  * P. 3 : Changed C20 Qty to 0 ; added information for MAX IV config.\n  * P. 7 : Changed R83 to 0R ; R84 Qty to 0"
